opics that were incomplete after $3$ weeks?" :question/worked-solution "If the number of incomplete topics decreased by $\\frac{1}{6}$ every week, then every week $\\frac{5}{6}$ of the topics remained incomplete.\n\nTherefore:\n\n- After $1$ week, $12\\cdot (\\frac{5}{6})$ topics were incomplete.\n\n- After $2$ weeks, approximately  $12\\cdot {(\\frac{5}{6})}^{2}$ topics were incomplete.\n\n- After $3$ weeks, approximately $12\\cdot {(\\frac{5}{6})}^{3}$ topics were incomplete."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060337 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cfd5bab8-cc6c-526b-8f16-42206a74a0dd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\cos (\\frac{3π}{7})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058645} {:answer/id #uuid "fd824005-035e-5ea7-b06d-39b7884726ce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\cos (\\frac{2π}{7})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058646} {:answer/id #uuid "089c6660-bc76-58a5-b455-0abc2bec3420" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\cos (\\frac{3π}{7})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058647} {:answer/id #uuid "2fc2e73f-0202-5e9c-ad48-672875e551c8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\cos (\\frac{2π}{7})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058648} {:answer/id #uuid "527bea15-d17a-54bd-adb3-b93a0c063662" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\cos (\\frac{π}{7})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058649}] :answer-field/id #uuid "e0ed008b-fd54-5c17-96db-b71af463f278" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186058644}] :question/id #uuid "7700d915-9757-53ac-a106-b09df400f8e4" :question/math-academy-id "q-64784" :question/problem "What is $\\cos (-\\frac{9π}{7})$ expressed in terms of a reference angle?"} {:db/id #edb/ref 175921860